{"language_code":"eng","language_probability":0.941735565662384,"text":"Dots, Muse, GroqBot, and MouseBot look similar, but they're actually built for four completely different kinds of work. OpenAI Dots is like an always-on worker inside ChatGPT. Give it an ongoing goal, connect your apps, and it keeps working in the background. Meta Muse is more personal, built for everyday tasks like bookings, shopping, forms, reminders, and long-term goals. GroqBot is more like building a team of AI coworkers. Give different bots different roles for research, sales, marketing, operations, and more. And MouseBot is the open source one. It runs on your own computer on any model you like, works in your real browser and apps, and checks with you on your phone before anything risky. So basically, Dots, ongoing work; Muse, personal life tasks; GroqBot, AI teams; and MouseBot, all three on your own computer. But they're very different when it comes to pricing, privacy, strengths, and limitations. MouseBot is free and open source. See the full comparison at mousebot.com.","words":[{"text":"Dots,","start":0.32,"end":0.66,"type":"word","logprob":-0.007402424495194282},{"text":" ","start":0.66,"end":0.8,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.004469761624932289},{"text":"Muse,","start":0.84,"end":1.18,"type":"word","logprob":-0.003576691446778568},{"text":" ","start":1.18,"end":1.32,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.0001821352052502334},{"text":"GroqBot,","start":1.32,"end":1.86,"type":"word","logprob":-0.16765749414480524},{"text":" ","start":1.86,"end":1.92,"type":"spacing","logprob":-2.3841855067985307e-7},{"text":"and","start":1.92,"end":2.02,"type":"word","logprob":-2.3841855067985307e-7},{"text":" ","start":2.02,"end":2.08,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.000445385929197073},{"text":"MouseBot","start":2.08,"end":2.56,"type":"word","logprob":-0.002921510487794876},{"text":" ","start":2.56,"end":2.94,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.000014543427823809907},{"text":"look","start":2.94,"end":3.06,"type":"wor